\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"space-y-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Before I Learned to Code\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"I went to the States when I was 19 and lived there for almost five years. Back then, my dad wanted me to become a pilot. I made it halfway through the training process… until financial problems, the pandemic, and rising expenses made it impossible to continue.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"These were dark days. I had no backup plans. I had invested years of my life thinking I’d become a pilot. I watched my co-pilots earn their licenses, helped them study, flew with them, and hyped them up for their flight exams. Deep down, I wished I was also achieving their milestones.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"It was heavy. It took a long time to accept that I wasn’t going to make a career out of flying. But I knew, at some point, I needed to stop wallowing and start over.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"img\\\",null,{\\\"src\\\":\\\"/images/about/flying-me-in-the-plane.png\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Emma flying a small plane during flight training\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"rounded-lg shadow-md w-full h-auto mx-auto\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"img\\\",null,{\\\"src\\\":\\\"/images/about/flying-me-with-flight-instructor.png\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Emma with flight instructor inside cockpit\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"rounded-lg shadow-md w-full h-auto mx-auto\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"img\\\",null,{\\\"src\\\":\\\"/images/about/in-my-pilot-uniform.png\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Emma wearing her pilot uniform smiling\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"rounded-lg shadow-md w-full h-auto mx-auto\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"img\\\",null,{\\\"src\\\":\\\"/images/about/passing-flight-exam.png\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Emma posing after passing a flight exam\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"rounded-lg shadow-md w-full h-auto mx-auto\\\"}]]}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"space-y-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"How I Discovered My Passion for Coding\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Coding gave me a way forward. I loved that I could sit in front of my computer and make things happen.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"There’s room for error, for creativity, and for flow. I could get lost in it for hours and not feel drained.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"pl-6\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"em\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Coding is everything that becoming a pilot is not.\\\"}]}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"In learning to code better, I also learned so much about myself.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"pl-6\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"strong\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"I love designing:\\\"}],\\\" playing with colors and grids. Learning to balance between functionality, aesthetic, and what I can actually code.\\\"]}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"pl-6\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"strong\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"I love writing:\\\"}],\\\" expressing myself through well-thought words. I have so many stories to tell, lessons to share, and love to give. I want them all in writing.\\\"]}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"pl-6\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"strong\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"I’m an introvert:\\\"}],\\\" I’m good with people, but at the end of the day, being alone with my thoughts is how I bring ideas to life.\\\"]}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"pl-6\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"strong\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"designing + writing + coding = web developer\\\"}]}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Learning how to code in order to build websites became a gateway to putting myself out there, letting people in, and helping them get to know me better.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"img\\\",null,{\\\"src\\\":\\\"/images/about/coding-journey.png\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Coding journey timeline collage\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"rounded-lg shadow-md w-full h-auto mx-auto\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"img\\\",null,{\\\"src\\\":\\\"/images/about/coding-school-starts.png\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"First day of coding school screenshot\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"rounded-lg shadow-md w-full h-auto mx-auto\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"img\\\",null,{\\\"src\\\":\\\"/images/about/in-class-coding-bootcamp.png\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"In-class bootcamp coding session\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"rounded-lg shadow-md w-full h-auto mx-auto\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"img\\\",null,{\\\"src\\\":\\\"/images/about/my-git-hub-account.png\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"My github account with Fullstack\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"rounded-lg shadow-md w-full h-auto mx-auto\\\"}]]}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"space-y-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"It Wasn’t Instant Success\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"I thought graduating from a bootcamp would make things easier. I was wrong.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Freelancing through Upwork and Fiverr was hard. I didn’t have real-life client experience or a solid portfolio. I had to grind my way into establishing myself as a web developer. And of course, a bootcamp doesn’t teach you everything. There's still a lot of self-learning involved.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"pt-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"img\\\",null,{\\\"src\\\":\\\"/images/about/vicious-cycle.png\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Visual diagram showing the cycle of study, code, build, find opportunities, feel inadequate, and improve\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"rounded-lg shadow-md w-2/3 sm:w-1/2 h-auto mx-auto\\\"}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"It was a cycle I had to repeat over and over. I realized I still had a long way to go. I realized I wasn’t special.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Looking back, I wasn’t hopeless. I was just focusing on the wrong things. I wanted to freelance right away when I should have been looking for a job to gain experience.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"space-y-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Why I Had to Come Home\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"I wanted to work in the States, but I was on a student visa. I wasn’t allowed to work, only study. That meant I had to find a company willing to sponsor my work visa.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"With little to no experience, and a highly competitive field, I didn’t stand a chance.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"pl-6\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"em\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Why would a company sponsor me over someone who was already a citizen?\\\"}]}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"pl-6\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"em\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"I had nothing to prove… yet.\\\"}]}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"It was one of the hardest decisions I’ve ever made. But I needed to show how committed I was. So I flew home to the Philippines to start over.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"space-y-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Finally Breaking Into Tech\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"After everything, I finally landed two jobs in tech.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"My first was as a \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"strong\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Web Support Specialist\\\"}],\\\" at a digital marketing company in the U.S. It was my entry point into the industry, a solid first job in my field. I learned a lot about maintaining websites, troubleshooting technical issues, and working with a team. It gave me the validation I needed and motivated me to keep going.\\\"]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Later, I worked as a\\\",\\\" \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"strong\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Freelance Web Developer\\\"}],\\\". A client, hired me to build a blog site. I had full control over the layout and design. It was the first time I built a real website for a real client. From start to finish, I got to bring something to life. It was both challenging and deeply rewarding.\\\"]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"I’m still building, still growing. The journey hasn’t been easy: frustrating, exhausting, and full of uncertainty.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"But I wouldn’t trade it for anything else.\\\"}]]}]]}],\\\"$undefined\\\",null,[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L8\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$L9\\\",\\\"$La\\\",null]}]]}],{},null,false]},null,false]},null,false],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"h\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[null,[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"YLSK_E6iGor3ANI3rN0O4\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$Lb\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"$Lc\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",null,{\\\"nam